<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Document</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/style.css">
    <style>
        {{{inlineResetStyles}}}
        {{{inlineStyles}}}
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="page">
        <header>
            <div class="text--right txt txt--xs">PC-G-16.1B (Rev. 8-2014)</div>
            <div class="text--center">
                <h2 class="mt-16 uppercase">PROBATE COURT OF FRANKLIN COUNTY, OHIO</h2>
                <h4 class="uppercase">JEFFREY D. MACKEY, JUDGE</h4>
            </div>
        </header>
        <div class="content">
            <div class="flex v--end h--start gap-4">
                <div class="txt txt--m uppercase w-auto">
                    <p>IN THE MATTER OF <br>THE GUARDIANSHIP OF</p>
                </div>
                <div class="input fullw">{{caseDetailsStep.guardianName}}</div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex v--end h--start gap-4 mt-16">
                <div class="txt txt--m uppercase w-auto">
                    <p>CASE NO.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="input w-auto mw-200">{{caseDetailsStep.caseNumber}}</div>
            </div>
            <div class="text--center mt-20">
                <h2>ADULT JURISDICTION AFFIDAVIT</h2>
                <div class="txt txt--s">
                    <p>[ORC 2112.01-2112.04]</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="text--left mt-30">
                <div class="txt txt--s">
                    <p>Affiant being first duly sworn, deposes and states:</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-16 grid gap-30">
                <div class="row">
                  <div class="txt txt--s">
                    <p>1A. The present address and the names of the person(s) with whom the Alleged Incompetent is presently living:</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex v--start h--start pl-20 gap-8 mt-16">
                    <div class="txt txt--s w-auto">Current address:</div>
                    <div class="input fullw">{{addressInformStep.currentAddress}}</div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex v--start h--start pl-30 gap-8 mt-16">
                    <div class="txt txt--s w-auto">From:</div>
                    <div class="input fullw">{{addressInformStep.from}}</div>
                    <div class="txt txt--s w-auto">To:</div>
                    <div class="input fullw">{{addressInformStep.to}}</div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex v--start h--start pl-30 gap-8 mt-16">
                    <div class="txt txt--s w-auto">With whom:</div>
                    <div class="input fullw">{{addressInformStep.withWhom}}</div>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div class="row">
                  <div class="txt txt--s">
                    <p>1B. Former addresses within the last two years:</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex v--start h--start pl-20 gap-8 mt-16">
                    <div class="txt txt--s w-auto">Address:</div>
                    <div class="input fullw">{{addressInformStep.previousAddresses.[0].address}}</div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex v--start h--start pl-30 gap-8 mt-16">
                    <div class="txt txt--s w-auto">From:</div>
                    <div class="input fullw">{{addressInformStep.previousAddresses.[0].from}}</div>
                    <div class="txt txt--s w-auto">To:</div>
                    <div class="input fullw">{{addressInformStep.previousAddresses.[0].to}}</div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex v--start h--start pl-30 gap-8 mt-16">
                    <div class="txt txt--s w-auto">With whom:</div>
                    <div class="input fullw">{{addressInformStep.previousAddresses.[0].withWhom}}</div>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div class="row">
                  <div class="flex v--start h--start pl-20 gap-8 mt-16">
                    <div class="txt txt--s w-auto">Address:</div>
                    <div class="input fullw">{{addressInformStep.previousAddresses.[1].address}}</div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex v--start h--start pl-30 gap-8 mt-16">
                    <div class="txt txt--s w-auto">From:</div>
                    <div class="input fullw">{{addressInformStep.previousAddresses.[1].from}}</div>
                    <div class="txt txt--s w-auto">To:</div>
                    <div class="input fullw">{{addressInformStep.previousAddresses.[1].to}}</div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex v--start h--start pl-30 gap-8 mt-16">
                    <div class="txt txt--s w-auto">With whom:</div>
                    <div class="input fullw">{{addressInformStep.previousAddresses.[1].withWhom}}</div>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div class="row">
                  <div class="flex v--start h--start pl-20 gap-8 mt-16">
                    <div class="txt txt--s w-auto">Address:</div>
                    <div class="input fullw">{{addressInformStep.previousAddresses.[2].address}}</div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex v--start h--start pl-30 gap-8 mt-16">
                    <div class="txt txt--s w-auto">From:</div>
                    <div class="input fullw">{{addressInformStep.previousAddresses.[2].from}}</div>
                    <div class="txt txt--s w-auto">To:</div>
                    <div class="input fullw">{{addressInformStep.previousAddresses.[2].to}}</div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex v--start h--start pl-30 gap-8 mt-16">
                    <div class="txt txt--s w-auto">With whom:</div>
                    <div class="input fullw">{{addressInformStep.previousAddresses.[2].withWhom}}</div>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div class="row">
                  <div class="flex v--start h--start pl-20 gap-8 mt-16">
                    <div class="txt txt--s w-auto">Address:</div>
                    <div class="input fullw">{{addressInformStep.previousAddresses.[3].address}}</div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex v--start h--start pl-30 gap-8 mt-16">
                    <div class="txt txt--s w-auto">From:</div>
                    <div class="input fullw">{{addressInformStep.previousAddresses.[3].from}}</div>
                    <div class="txt txt--s w-auto">To:</div>
                    <div class="input fullw">{{addressInformStep.previousAddresses.[3].to}}</div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex v--start h--start pl-30 gap-8 mt-16">
                    <div class="txt txt--s w-auto">With whom:</div>
                    <div class="input fullw">{{addressInformStep.previousAddresses.[3].withWhom}}</div>
                  </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <footer class="mt-auto">
            <div class="flex v--center h--between">
              <div class="txt txt--s">16.1</div>
              <div class="text--center fw-600 txt txt--s uppercase">
                FRANKLIN COUNTY FORM G-16.1B - ADULT JURISDICTION AFFIDAVIT
              </div>
              <div class="txt txt--s pr-20"></div>
            </div>
        </footer>
    </div>

    <!--page 2-->

    <div class="page">
        <header>
            <div class="flex v--end h--end gap-4 mt-16">
                <div class="txt txt--m uppercase w-auto">
                    <p>CASE NO.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="input w-auto mw-200">{{caseDetailsStep.caseNumber}}</div>
            </div>
        </header>
        <div class="content">
            <div class="grid gap-20">
              <div class="flex v--start h--start gap-10">
                <div class="txt txt--s w-auto lh-140">2.</div>
                <div class="right">
                  <div class="txt txt--s lh-140">
                    <p>Said affiant 
                      <span class="checkbox">{{#ifEquals legalQuestionsStep.isAffiantHaveInfoAboutAnyGuardianship true}}✓{{/ifEquals}}</span> does 
                      <span class="checkbox">{{#ifEquals legalQuestionsStep.isAffiantHaveInfoAboutAnyGuardianship false}}✓{{/ifEquals}}</span> 
                      does not have information of any guardianship/conservatorship/curatorship/tutorship proceeding concerning the alleged incompetent pending in a court of this or another state. Said affiant has the following knowledge regarding information set forth in paragraph two (2) above:</p>
                  </div>
                  {{#if legalQuestionsStep.infoAboutCourtProceeding}}
                  <div class="input fullw mt-8">{{legalQuestionsStep.infoAboutCourtProceeding}}</div>
                  {{else}}
                  <div class="input fullw mt-8"></div>
                  <div class="input fullw mt-8"></div>
                  <div class="input fullw mt-8"></div>
                  {{/if}}
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="flex v--start h--start gap-10">
                <div class="txt txt--s w-auto lh-140">3.</div>
                <div class="right">
                  <div class="txt txt--s lh-140">
                    <p>Said affiant has a continuing duty to inform the court of any proceeding concerning the alleged incompetent in this or any other state of which the affiant obtained information during this proceeding.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="flex v--start h--start gap-10">
                <div class="txt txt--s w-auto lh-140">4.</div>
                <div class="right">
                  <div class="txt txt--s lh-140">
                    <p>The Alleged Incompetent 
                      <span class="checkbox">{{#ifEquals legalQuestionsStep.isAllegedIncompetentDivorced true}}✓{{/ifEquals}}</span>is <span class="checkbox">{{#ifEquals legalQuestionsStep.isAllegedIncompetentDivorced false}}✓{{/ifEquals}}</span>is not divorced.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="flex v--start h--start gap-10">
                <div class="txt txt--s w-auto lh-140">5.</div>
                <div class="right">
                  <div class="txt txt--s lh-140">
                    <p><span class="checkbox">{{#ifEquals legalQuestionsStep.isDivorcePending false}}✓{{/ifEquals}}</span>There are not divorce proceedings pending.</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="txt txt--s lh-140 mt-8">
                    <p><span class="checkbox">{{#ifEquals legalQuestionsStep.isDivorcePending true}}✓{{/ifEquals}}</span>There is a divorce case pending in <span class="input mw-300">{{legalQuestionsStep.courtName}}</span> Court.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="flex v--start h--start gap-10">
                <div class="txt txt--s w-auto lh-140">6.</div>
                <div class="right">
                  <div class="txt txt--s lh-140">
                    <p>The alleged incompetent 
                      <span class="checkbox">{{#ifEquals legalQuestionsStep.isAllegedIncompetentCurrently true}}✓{{/ifEquals}}</span>is 
                      <span class="checkbox">{{#ifEquals legalQuestionsStep.isAllegedIncompetentCurrently false}}✓{{/ifEquals}}</span>is not subject to continuing custody in a domestic order issued in the divorce of the alleged incompetent’s parents.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="mt-30">
                <div class="flex">
                  <div class="txt txt--s lh-140 w-auto">
                    <p>Additional Information:</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="input fullw"></div>
                </div>
                {{#if legalQuestionsStep.additionalInfo}}
                <div class="input fullw mt-8">{{legalQuestionsStep.additionalInfo}}</div>
                {{else}}
                <div class="input fullw mt-8"></div>
                <div class="input fullw mt-8"></div>
                <div class="input fullw mt-8"></div>
                {{/if}}
              </div>

              <div class="txt txt--s mt-20"><p>Said affiant states that all of the foregoing statements are true.</p></div>

              <div class="mt-30 pt-20 grid col-2 gap-20">
                <div class="col">
                </div>
                <div class="col">
                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="input fullw text--center">{{caseDetailsStep.applicantName}}</div>
                        <div class="txt txt--xs mt-4 text--center">Affiant/Applicant</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="txt txt--s mt-20"><p>Sworn to and subscribed before me a Notary Public or Deputy Clerk of the Probate Court on this <span class="input mw-80"></span> day of <span class="input mw-200"></span>, 20 <span class="input mw-80"></span>.</p></div>

              <div class="mt-30 grid col-2 gap-20">
                <div class="col">
                </div>
                <div class="col">
                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="input fullw text--center"></div>
                        <div class="txt txt--xs mt-4 text--center">Notary Public/Deputy Clerk</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
              </div>


            </div>
        </div>

        <footer class="mt-auto">
            <div class="flex v--center h--center">
              <div class="text--center fw-600 txt txt--s uppercase">
                FRANKLIN COUNTY FORM G-16.1B - ADULT JURISDICTION AFFIDAVIT
              </div>
            </div>
        </footer>
    </div>
</body>
</html>